\ A helper that calls itself reads its own name, which is bound only after its literal is pushed.
\ Nothing captured that binding, so the interpreter finds it through the live frame chain, and
\ compiled code would not. The build refuses the word rather than let the two diverge.

self-recursive: ( n: fixnum -- n ) [
  down: [ dup 0 > [ 1 - down ] when ] ;
  down
] ;

3 self-recursive .
